    "identifier": "disciplined-illusions",
    "description": "<p>Once per turn, when you cast a Genjutsu, you can gain Discipline in place of casting a Bukijutsu. If you gained Discipline as a result of the Discipline class feature by casting a Bukijutsu with the Chain keyword already this turn, you cannot gain Discipline by casting a Genjutsu the same turn. You cannot use Discipline Ninshou in the same turn you use this Kata.</p>\n<p>You gain a number of Discipline based on the rank of the Genjutsu Cast; (D-Rank/C-Rank: 1 Discipline,  B-Rank/A-Rank: 2 Discipline, S-Rank: 3 Discipline)</p>",
